      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "title": "University entry needs B2",
      "body": "<span style=\"color:#ffdd00\">Research: Students below B2 lack the language skills to master their studies — regardless of subject.</span>",
      "notes": "Source: The Adequacy of the B2 Level as University Entrance Requirement, ResearchGate 2018"
    },
    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "b2-jobs",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "title": "B2 means better jobs &amp; pay",
      "body": "<span style=\"color:#ffdd00\">International companies pay <strong>20–50% more</strong> for roles needing B2 English. Same job at an MNC = <strong>฿15,000–35,000 extra</strong> per month.</span>",
      "notes": "Source: ALA Language School — international company roles pay 20-50% more for B2. Michael Page 2026 Salary Guide — English premium 10-15%."
