    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "reflection",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "body": "<span class=\"box-word\">Write</span> your answers in your notebook.\n\nWhich skill do we need to improve the **most**?\n\nHow can **we** do it?",
      "notes": "Give 3 min. Then ask a few students to share. Encourage specific strategies."
    },
    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "improve-tips",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "title": "Ideas to improve",
      "body": "**Reading** — Read one short article a day. Summarise it in 2 sentences.\n\n**Listening** — Watch short videos with English subtitles. Pause and repeat.\n\n**Writing** — Write 3 sentences every day. Use new vocabulary.\n\n**Vocabulary** — Use a vocab notebook. Review 5 words each day.",
      "notes": "Ask students: Which strategy will you try this week?"
    },
