    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "why-vocab",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "body": "Strong vocab, grammar, and spelling help you in ALL skills.\n\n**Reading** — You understand more words = you read faster.\n\n**Writing** — Correct spelling and grammar = clearer ideas.\n\n**Listening** — You recognise words faster = you follow better.\n\n**Your finals** will test all of this at the end of the year.",
      "notes": "Emphasise: these are foundational skills that support everything else."
    },
